"title":"Learning rate 1e-3: no gain","text":"Forked z1 at iteration 726 with lr 1e-3 (was 3e-4): KL rose from 0.002 to 0.006 and entropy from 0.15 to 0.18, but over 30 iterations the evaluation against the GA base was 0.692 vs z1's 0.704 and the training score against rl-v1 0.433 vs 0.448. Not worth the risk; stopped."},{"t":"2026-11-18 15:52:30","kind":"journal","title":"Checked: +Actions, +Cards and +Buys work","text":"New tests (tests/test_vanilla.py): every card's +Cards/+Actions/+Buys/+$ is right in the engine, and in C-engine games through the network's decision interface a player is asked again after a Village or a Market, never beyond what the bonuses allow. The trained net uses a second buy as often as the GA genome (76% vs 72% of the turns it played a +Buy card), but it rarely chains actions: 0.51 actions per turn and 6% of turns with 2+ actions, against rl-v1's 1.61 and 28%. Self-play from zero found money + attacks (Witch, Militia, Gardens) and not engines (experiments/turn_usage.py)."},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-18 15:42:00","label":"z1 iteration 775","note":"","policy":"runs/z1/net_775.npy","n":1000,"score":0.6785,"ci":[0.6489,0.7067],"big_money":0.8875,"smithy_bm":0.76,"witch_bm":0.73,"secs":4,"vs_rl":0.3545,"vs_rl_ci":[0.3255,0.3847],"vs_rl_n":1000,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-18 15:41:19","label":"z1lr iteration 750","note":"","policy":"runs/z1lr/net_750.npy","n":1000,"score":0.706,"ci":[0.677,0.7334],"big_money":0.8825,"smithy_bm":0.7225,"witch_bm":0.7075,"secs":4,"vs_rl":0.358,"vs_rl_ci":[0.3289,0.3882],"vs_rl_n":1000,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-18 15:26:52","label":"z1 iteration 750","note":"","policy":"runs/z1/net_750.npy","n":1000,"score":0.6865,"ci":[0.6571,0.7145],"big_money":0.8475,"smithy_bm":0.7475,"witch_bm":0.69,"secs":4,"vs_rl":0.367,"vs_rl_ci":[0.3377,0.3973],"vs_rl_n":1000,"replay":null},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-18 15:12:38","label":"z1 iteration 725","note":"","policy":"runs/z